  "data": {
    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Deathwatch Support",
    "summary": "Your KILL TEAM units that have this rule gain three abilities tied to their doctrine. Furor Tactics: with the devastator doctrine active for the unit, its attacks gain [SUSTAINED HITS 1]. Malleus Tactics: with the tactical doctrine active, its attacks gain [LETHAL HITS]. Purgatus Tactics: with the assault doctrine active, its attacks gain [PRECISION] against enemy units no more than 9\" away from it. DEATHWATCH ALLIES: your army may include DEATHWATCH units even though their Chapter keyword differs, as long as they total no more than 500 points; this is an exception to Space Marine Chapters Army Rules. Unless something says otherwise, no DEATHWATCH model may be your WARLORD, and KILL TEAM units may only take Enhancements from this detachment.",
